{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"world_three_moons","name_zh":"三月与月神","name_en":"Three Moons and Moon Goddesses","aliases":["三月与月神","三月","三月女神","三位月神","三位月之女神","Three Moons and Moon Goddesses","Three Moons","Three Moon Goddesses","Three Moon Sisters"],"category":"cosmology","scope":"global","regions":[],"summary":"三月既指提瓦特远古的三轮月亮，也指分别与之对应的三位月神。三月由尼伯龙根升起，用以维系世界并代行其权能；葬火之战中，两轮月亮被击碎，霜月被抛至虚假之天外，三位旧月神随后相继逝去。后世只留下相互矛盾的传说，直至哥伦比娅逆行至过去并承接三月权能，成为新的、唯一的三月女神。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_001","text":"“三月”可指三轮远古天体，也可指与其分别对应、合称三月女神或三月姐妹的三位神明。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_002","text":"最初的天空没有三月；尼伯龙根以古龙技术将三轮月亮升入天际，三位月神由此诞生，成为其意志与威权的延伸，代其监察并维系提瓦特。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"提瓦特早期","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_04","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_003","text":"三月所承载的权能涉及提瓦特、世界的存续运转以及生、死、时间与空间等根本法则；三位月神曾将力量均分，以避免任何一位过于强大。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"三月完整存在时期","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_004","text":"三轮月亮及其旧月神分别为：最大的恒月与艾莉亚、最明亮的霜月与卡侬、最小且光芒微弱的虹月与桑娜妲。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"三月完整存在时期至旧月神逝去","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_03"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_005","text":"三位姐妹曾轮流执掌夜空并乘银色高车巡天，约每一旬交替一次；轮值偶尔会因彼此代班而混乱，甚至使三月同时出现。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"三月完整存在时期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_006","text":"据月神自身经历的汇总，天理初至提瓦特时，月神并未察觉恶意，曾将其视作来客而和平共存；当天理改写世界规则时，桑娜妲反对，艾莉亚与卡侬则选择观察新秩序究竟会带来善果还是恶果。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"天理抵达提瓦特初期","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_007","text":"部分古代文明曾崇拜三月。伊尔明苏接替相关职能之前，月亮还被描述为亡者灵魂的归宿，由“船工”将逝者送往月上的城市安息。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战以前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_008","text":"尼伯龙根携深渊力量归来并与天理开战时，三位月神在追随造物主还是保持中立、避免世界进一步破碎的问题上发生分歧。尼伯龙根将犹疑视为不忠，把她们囚禁于名为“moon's reflection”的扭曲时空囚笼，并将三轮月亮改造成战争武器。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_009","text":"关于天理摧毁三月时是否知道月神已经遭到囚禁，存在不同说法：一种说法认为天理并不知情，因而把月亮武器化视作月神首先违背和平誓言；其真实知情程度未获确定。","status":"disputed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_010","text":"葬火之战中，天理击碎恒月与虹月，并把未破碎的霜月抛至虚假之天外。三月自此失去与提瓦特的正常联系，三位旧月神受到世界排斥、力量持续流失，最终相继逝去。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战及其后","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_011","text":"恒月破碎后，艾莉亚的遗留力量凝成月髓；虹月破碎后，桑娜妲为延续生命而使灵魂与深渊力量结合，形成赤月并长期承受痛苦；霜月本体虽未破碎，却在虚假之天外变得黑暗而失去生命，卡侬维持一段时间后也因世界排斥而死。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战后","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_012","text":"天理以投射在虚假之天上的幻象“shadowmoon”遮掩三月的真实命运。霜月后来重新回到虚假之天下方后，该幻象失去作用并最终消散。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"葬火之战后至当代","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_013","text":"三月消失后成为遍布提瓦特残篇、壁画和文学作品的神话历史形象。流传说法彼此矛盾，包括三姐妹反目相杀、仅两位姐妹死亡、现今所见月亮是一具遗骸，或最后一位月神因悲恸而闭居月宫等版本。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"葬火之战后","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_014","text":"当代曾有人击破虚假之天的一角，使恒月的破碎遗骸短暂显露；多数人接受了“天文异常”的公开解释，三月与虚假之天的真相仍未成为普遍知识。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当代","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_015","text":"哥伦比娅进入“moon's reflection”并逆时间而行，最终与被囚禁时期的三位旧月神相遇。旧月神将三月权能全部转交给哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅，使她成为世界上唯一的三月女神；月亮残骸本身的力量并未一并转交。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"由当代逆行至葬火之战时期的交会事件","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_02","local_sup_world_three_moons_03"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_moons_fact_016","text":"在当代事件结束后，霜月重新建立了与提瓦特的联系并返回虚假之天下方，哥伦比娅复苏，三枚月髓被夺回；恒月与虹月仍处于破碎状态。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当代最新状态","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"提瓦特早期","order_hint":10,"events":["尼伯龙根以古龙技术升起三轮月亮，三位月神随之诞生，作为其意志延伸而维系世界。"],"current_status":"三月与三位旧月神均完整存在。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_04","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"period":"天理抵达后","order_hint":20,"events":["三位月神起初接受天理的存在；天理利用其权能改写提瓦特规则。","月神对新秩序的态度出现分歧，而龙族因她们未在战争中援助同源的龙族而将其视为叛徒。"],"current_status":"三月仍被保留，但旧有同盟与信任已经破裂。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"period":"葬火之战","order_hint":30,"events":["归来的尼伯龙根因三位月神的犹疑而将其囚禁，并把三月改造成战争武器。","天理击碎恒月与虹月，将霜月抛至虚假之天外。"],"current_status":"两轮月亮破碎，霜月与提瓦特断开，三月体系崩溃。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"period":"葬火之战后","order_hint":40,"events":["旧月神因世界排斥与月体毁坏或失联而相继逝去，遗留力量形成月髓。","天理以“shadowmoon”遮掩三月的真实命运，后世仅存矛盾的神话与残缺记录。"],"current_status":"三位旧月神均已逝去，真实历史成为少数人才掌握的隐秘。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","bwiki_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_01"]},{"period":"空月之歌时期的逆时交会","order_hint":50,"events":["哥伦比娅沿“moon's reflection”逆行至三位旧月神被囚禁的时代。","三位旧月神把三月权能全部转交给哥伦比娅，使她成为唯一的三月女神。"],"current_status":"旧月神失去神性而成为凡身；三月权能由哥伦比娅承接。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","local_sup_world_three_moons_02","local_sup_world_three_moons_03"]},{"period":"当代最新状态","order_hint":60,"events":["霜月重新回到虚假之天下方并恢复与提瓦特的联系，哥伦比娅复苏。","三枚月髓被夺回；用于遮掩三月命运的“shadowmoon”随后完全消散。"],"current_status":"哥伦比娅是唯一的三月女神；霜月已经返回，恒月与虹月仍然破碎。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_moons","fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"提瓦特各地流传三位月亮姐妹、银色高车与月宫的故事，但普通人接触到的版本相互矛盾。三月的真实起源、葬火之战中的囚禁与毁灭、虚假之天及当代权能转移均不是公共知识。","likely_known_by":["三位旧月神与哥伦比娅","尼可等掌握远古历史的少数知情者","亲历哥伦比娅逆时事件及其复苏行动的人","保存古代记载、壁画或月髓的特定群体","部分天使、龙族及与葬火之战直接相关的古老存在"],"unlikely_known_by":["提瓦特普通居民","仅通过民间文学与传说接触三月故事的人","接受“天文异常”公开解释而未接触内幕的人"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["三位月神是居住在月宫、轮流乘银色高车巡天的姐妹。","三姐妹在灾难中反目并相互杀害。","只有两位月神死亡，现今天空中的月亮是幸存者或其中一位的遗骸。","最后一位月神因姐妹死亡而悲痛，从此不再离开月宫。","虚假之天破裂时显露的月骸只是普通的天文异常。"]},"activation_keys":["三月与月神","三月","三月女神","三位月神","三位月之女神","恒月","霜月","虹月","艾莉亚","卡侬","桑娜妲","Three Moons and Moon Goddesses","Three Moons","Three Moon Goddesses","Three Moon Sisters"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["任务步骤、特殊剧情模式、队伍限制与成就奖励","深境螺旋奖励刷新及渊月祝福等玩法机制","角色技能、普通攻击、合成台和界面图案等视觉联想","空月祝福图标变化等月卡或UI内容"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Fandom正文声称三位月神开始采用人形且艾莉亚最后化为人形，但该句没有引证，补充的任务转录也未直接证明，故未纳入事实。","BWiki中以画面相似、图案对应、名称联想或“应为”“可能”等方式提出的编辑者推断。","仅凭角色、设施或法阵外观推断其与三月存在设定联系的玩家理论。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_world_three_moons","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Three Moons","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Three_Moons","language":"en","revision_id":"2136349","source_text_sha256":"55e8f4053dc4f9eb827d7bd9c4943a24ffa3ce5624547b67347800b40b1c5397"},{"source_id":"bwiki_world_three_moons","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"三月","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%88","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"674048","source_text_sha256":"a0116dac41649fbee336beaf342684fd5266dac2a8fe870bcdeacdcd071a4119"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_world_three_moons_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Three Moons","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Three_Moons","language":"en","revision_id":"2136349","source_text_sha256":"33045096fb6f7297aabea40f3152ed8732f6c1480c03e365e2f7c5089dbc1bc2"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_world_three_moons_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"The First Sliver of Moonlight","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/The_First_Sliver_of_Moonlight","language":"en","revision_id":"2126449","source_text_sha256":"ec67ac13749f5a4ba67499a0acc008c99cbbecc9eb242332ad4d341734ea0b4e"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_moons_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"名于何处？","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6024.json#unit=602404","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"32ae68c411ed833f5f0a56c148790a3f252e0a8071f812b331a19a6de81cb4c7"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_moons_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"最初的那抹月光","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6015.json#unit=601517","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"4ee6fa57ab6bbe72412202c0ea60b2d49d926d4b66969ea015204b3c78ad34f9"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_moons_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"最初的那抹月光","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6015.json#unit=601510","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"fd15b3eeda7276f2040c179c751c775e0d37911c62e64ccdf3e93e28263f7a0a"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"83e4b12d0f89b4d82faf6d42ea1f5de53d0fec16bfa2fb2656b14053972c3b40","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["天理摧毁三月时是否知晓三位月神已被尼伯龙根囚禁，现有材料保留了不同说法。","三位旧月神究竟被囚禁了多长时间，现有材料明确称并不清楚。","各地关于三姐妹反目、幸存者与月亮尸骸的说法属于互相矛盾的后世传说，不能等同于已确认历史。","“三位月神曾采用人形，且艾莉亚最后化为人形”仅见于无引证的Fandom陈述，直接任务文本没有确认。"],"missing_evidence":["缺少能够直接证明三位月神曾采用人形，以及艾莉亚是最后化为人形者的游戏文本或有明确引证的Fandom正文；该陈述未纳入事实。"],"needs_human_review":true}}